@startuml flow_s4_init_swimlane
' Scenario 4 - Volt-Var HIL : Initialization & Teardown (swimlane form)
' Verified against scenario_4_volt_var.py (run_scenario_4 / _run_loop) and
' volt_var_controller.py (VoltVarController.__init__ / configure, and
' ArduinoSerialInterface.open / configure / close).
'
' Control-flow facts encoded here:
'   * DER sgen idx / buses / installed MW are resolved in
'     VoltVarController.__init__ (the "construct control objects" step),
'     NOT in configure().
'   * VoltVarController.configure() is a NO-OP in dry-run and performs the
'     INIT/CFG/P serial handshake only in HIL -> it lives INSIDE the HIL
'     branch, after open().
'   * _run_loop (configure -> dynamics.reset -> per-timestep loop) is the
'     body that the `if dry_run` dispatch wraps. In HIL it is wrapped by
'     the ArduinoSerialInterface context manager: open() on enter,
'     close()/END on exit (after the loop, before from_records()).
'   * Both branches merge and run ScenarioResult.from_records() ONCE.
'
' Render: plantuml -tsvg flow_s4_init_swimlane.puml
'         plantuml -tpdf flow_s4_init_swimlane.puml

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #8A887F
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor #8A887F
skinparam ArrowColor #1B1B1A

|Master · scenario_4_volt_var.py|
start
:run_scenario_4(net, profiles, port,
dry_run, coordination, v_min/v_max);
:adapt_profiles(net)
-> ap : DER P, load P/Q, times, dt_s;

|Publisher|
:on_scenario_start
write topology, open stream;

|Master · scenario_4_volt_var.py|
:drop stale controllers
reset_results(net);
:construct control objects
VoltVarController(...) resolves DER idx / buses / MW
+ SensitivityCoordinator + DERDynamics;

if (dry_run?) then (no - HIL)
  |Hardware interface (HIL only)|
  :open() /dev/ttyACM0 @115200
  capacitor reset, flush buffer;
  :configure(): handshake INIT -> CFG -> P
  (see sequence diagram); configured = true;
else (yes - dry-run)
  |Master · scenario_4_volt_var.py|
  :configure() is a no-op
  Q computed locally via QVCharacteristic;
endif

|Master · scenario_4_volt_var.py|
:dynamics.reset()
seed q_prev=0, p_prev=P[t0];
:== per-timestep loop ==
(Diagram 2);

if (dry_run?) then (no - HIL)
  |Hardware interface (HIL only)|
  :close() -> TX END
  firmware clears configured, port closed;
else (yes - dry-run)
endif

|Python sub-modules|
:ScenarioResult.from_records()
reduce per-step records -> summary;

|Publisher|
:on_scenario_end
flush summary frame;

|Master · scenario_4_volt_var.py|
:return ScenarioResult;
stop

@enduml
